			"notes": "━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🔥  **VortexMobs 1.1.0 — THE ELITE UPDATE**\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n\nYour mobs just got a whole lot scarier.\n\n👹 **ELITE MOB AFFIXES**\nSix deadly elite variants can now spawn on any hostile mob, each with unique stats, a glowing prefix tag, and their own reward multiplier:\n> 🩸 **Bloodforged** — regenerates, hits like a truck\n> 🦎 **Stalker** — moves fast, approaches silently\n> 🐺 **Warpack** — buffs nearby mobs, pack hunter\n> 🏰 **Siegeborn** — fortified, siege event tied\n> 👻 **Wraith** — phases through, Shadow Surge linked\n> 🕷️ **VenomCrawler** — applies poison stacks, deadly in waves\n\nElites spawn at a configurable base chance and get a bonus chance boost during their linked invasion event. All tunable in `config.yml`.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🌙 **INVASION EVENT AUDIOVISUAL IDENTITY**\nSix invasion events now have full A/V identities — particle storms, broadcast headlines, start/end sounds, and ambient mob auras:\n> 🔴 Blood Moon — crimson sky particles, war horn\n> 🐾 Predator Hunt — stalker ambience, hunt alarm\n> 🐺 Pack Assault — howl burst, pack rally sound\n> 🏰 Siege Night — siege horn, iron clash\n> 🌑 Shadow Surge — void particles, spectral drone\n> 🌅 Corrupted Dawn — corruption wisps, ominous bells\n\nEach event fires a server-wide headline broadcast on start and end. All disabled by default — you opt in.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📖 **PAGINATED DROP CATALOG**\nThe admin drop editor now has a full catalog with category filters and pagination:\n> 🟢 **Tracked** — only mobs you've touched\n> ⚔️ **All Hostile** — every vanilla hostile\n> 👹 **Elite Variants** — per-affix drop tables with base-type fallback\n\nNo more scrolling one endless list. Flip pages, switch filters, done.\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n🐛 **FIXES**\n- Right-click a biome in the editor now correctly resets its multiplier to `1.00`\n- Elite drop tables correctly fall back to the base mob table when no overrides are set\n\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━\n📦 **Downloads:** Paper/Folia · Purpur · Spigot · Fabric 1.21.x · Fabric 26.x\n━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━━"
		},
